Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.96,0:00:17.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\move(960,1020,960,1016,0,120)}On the flat sheet, at the smallest test\N{\c&H7AAF1B&}eta{\c&HF7F4F2&}, the poll keeps ninety-nine percent.
